; Variable: the order between viewport passes. Godot draws the deepest level of nested viewports
; first, the viewports of one level in tree order (renderer_viewport.cpp:91-125). Every other
; golden samples a viewport at its own level or below it, where each order draws the same frame.
; Left: ONCE A (level 1, transparent_bg) samples B/B1/B2 (level 3): B2 draws first, blue.
; Middle: ONCE C/C1/C2 (level 3) samples D (level 1, earlier in the tree): C2 draws first, empty.
; Right, the control: ONCE E/E1 samples F/F1, both level 2, E first in the tree: empty.

